{"id":"su_nde","lemma":"Sünde","pos":"noun","rank":2256,"glosses":["sin"],"ipa":"/ˈzʏndə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ca/De-S%C3%BCnde.ogg/De-S%C3%BCnde.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Sünde","plural":"Sünden"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich beichtete meine Sünde.","en":"I confessed my sin.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391536","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to confess","l":"beichten"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist keine Sünde, jemanden zu lieben.","en":"It isn't a sin to love somebody.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"someone, somebody","l":"jemand"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to love"}]},{"text":"Er beichtete all seine Sünden.","en":"He confessed all his sins.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to confess","l":"beichten"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Ist es immer eine Sünde, zu lügen?","en":"Is it always a sin to tell a lie?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to tell a lie"}]},{"text":"Das gilt als Sünde.","en":"That's considered a sin.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to be valid","l":"gelten"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null]}]}